1
00:00:00,599 --> 00:00:01,875
Oh No My Hair.

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,706
A two-player puzzle platformer.

3
00:00:05,451 --> 00:00:08,112
Bad hair. Good friends.

4
00:00:10,766 --> 00:00:13,819
We're NPC Union, a two-person team.

5
00:00:14,564 --> 00:00:17,150
We started with a forty-eight-hour jam and the

6
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,561
theme Better Together.

7
00:00:19,307 --> 00:00:21,733
We've kept building one escape where helping

8
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:23,426
your friend is the whole point.

9
00:00:28,766 --> 00:00:30,680
Two friends visit a salon.

10
00:00:31,424 --> 00:00:34,562
The robot assistant cuts too much, their hair

11
00:00:34,562 --> 00:00:37,309
gets powers, and the front door locks.

12
00:00:38,054 --> 00:00:40,250
Now they have to escape together.

13
00:00:42,932 --> 00:00:45,971
Twin-Tails can glide and carry her friend across

14
00:00:45,971 --> 00:00:50,309
gaps. Pompadour can dash through hair gel, parry

15
00:00:50,309 --> 00:00:52,896
scissors, and launch her from his head.

16
00:00:53,642 --> 00:00:56,411
Put those abilities together, and you can reach

17
00:00:56,411 --> 00:00:58,815
places neither friend could reach alone.

18
00:01:03,932 --> 00:01:05,944
This gel curtain grows back.

19
00:01:06,688 --> 00:01:08,994
Carrying your friend gets you to the wall,

20
00:01:09,188 --> 00:01:11,004
but you still can't get through.

21
00:01:11,750 --> 00:01:13,774
So she carries him over the gap.

22
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:16,701
He dashes out of her grip and breaks

23
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:20,306
the gel. She follows before it closes.

24
00:01:21,051 --> 00:01:22,328
Watch their timing.

25
00:01:29,932 --> 00:01:31,905
This door needs a bell that's out of

26
00:01:31,905 --> 00:01:35,801
reach. Pompadour parries a scissor, sending it

27
00:01:35,801 --> 00:01:39,465
back horizontally. Twin-Tails catches the blue

28
00:01:39,465 --> 00:01:41,943
scissor, then tosses it straight up.

29
00:01:42,688 --> 00:01:45,483
The enemy's attack becomes the tool that opens

30
00:01:45,483 --> 00:01:49,418
your route. Both players have a job in that chain.

31
00:01:54,932 --> 00:01:57,495
Get soaked and Twin-Tails can't glide.

32
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,203
Pompadour can't break gel.

33
00:02:00,948 --> 00:02:04,075
Warm air dries you off and lifts Twin-Tails.

34
00:02:04,821 --> 00:02:07,370
Carry your friend into it, and you rise

35
00:02:07,370 --> 00:02:10,630
together. You have to choose when to cross

36
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:12,776
the showers, and when to wait.

37
00:02:15,432 --> 00:02:17,983
A barber's chair swaps your haircuts.

38
00:02:18,728 --> 00:02:20,933
The powers go with the hair, so the

39
00:02:20,933 --> 00:02:23,521
person who was carrying now needs a lift.

40
00:02:24,267 --> 00:02:26,033
You have to switch jobs.

41
00:02:28,699 --> 00:02:31,324
The escape ends at the robot assistant.

42
00:02:32,068 --> 00:02:34,288
It charges and throws scissors.

43
00:02:35,034 --> 00:02:38,406
Later phases bring showers and reinforcements.

44
00:02:39,151 --> 00:02:42,240
Stun it, launch your friend, and land on

45
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:45,450
its head. The moves you've learned become your

46
00:02:45,450 --> 00:02:47,021
way through the final fight.

47
00:02:49,699 --> 00:02:52,040
We're making this for two people who enjoy

48
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:55,289
solving something together, sharing one keyboard.

49
00:02:56,034 --> 00:02:58,217
The prototype runs in a browser.

50
00:02:58,963 --> 00:03:01,450
PICO PARK and ibb and obb are useful

51
00:03:01,450 --> 00:03:05,826
reference points. Our focus is hair-powered combinations

52
00:03:05,826 --> 00:03:07,936
inside one mischievous salon.

53
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:14,030
The playable prototype has four chapters, twelve

54
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:17,733
rooms, saved progress, and a three-phase boss.

55
00:03:18,478 --> 00:03:21,444
It starts with learning each haircut, then asks

56
00:03:21,444 --> 00:03:23,921
you to combine them under new conditions.

57
00:03:24,667 --> 00:03:26,973
Every exit needs both friends.

58
00:03:29,632 --> 00:03:32,647
Next, we want twenty pairs to play without

59
00:03:32,647 --> 00:03:34,377
us explaining the puzzles.

60
00:03:35,121 --> 00:03:36,998
Can they learn the first combo?

61
00:03:37,744 --> 00:03:39,081
Where do they get stuck?

62
00:03:39,827 --> 00:03:41,361
Do they choose another room?

63
00:03:42,107 --> 00:03:44,913
Our proposed twelve-week plan starts with those

64
00:03:44,913 --> 00:03:48,639
tests, then clearer tutorials, room and audio

65
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:52,244
polish, accessibility, and release preparation.

66
00:03:54,899 --> 00:03:57,938
We estimate seventeen thousand two hundred US

67
00:03:57,938 --> 00:04:00,109
dollars for that twelve-week plan.

68
00:04:00,854 --> 00:04:04,214
It covers our time, commissioned art and audio,

69
00:04:04,432 --> 00:04:07,425
launch costs, and a twenty-percent buffer.

70
00:04:08,170 --> 00:04:11,087
The immediate help we're looking for is playtesters

71
00:04:11,087 --> 00:04:12,069
and mentoring.

72
00:04:14,732 --> 00:04:16,877
Grab the person next to you and try

73
00:04:16,877 --> 00:04:19,988
the prototype. We'd love to see how you

74
00:04:19,988 --> 00:04:21,216
solve it together.

75
00:04:21,961 --> 00:04:24,045
Scan the code to play Oh No My

76
00:04:24,045 --> 00:04:26,522
Hair. Thanks for watching.
